# data/*.csv and model/*.pkl were gitignored (regenerable artifacts) for solo local dev.
# Now tracked deliberately: Streamlit Community Cloud only runs `pip install` + `streamlit
# run app.py` on deploy, it doesn't run data_gen.py/train_model.py for you — so these need
# to actually be in the repo for the deployed app to work at all, not just regenerable.
